# Waitlist form (homepage "Join the pilot" section).
# 1. Create a free account at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form, copy its form ID (the part after /f/ in the endpoint URL)
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the ID below
# 4. Restart the dev server / redeploy
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
